{"data": [{"author_id": "1380720896038424579", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:42:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117975791611027542"], "id": "2117975791611027542", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 617, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11月4日的股市复盘\n\n大资金：全天流入580亿，其中超大资金流入533亿\n\n散户：净流出约500亿\n北向资金：放量660亿，净流入375亿\n量化资金：未完全跟随北向，买入卖出方向仅跟了六成\n\n【超大资金动向】\n买入前五：融资融券、半导体芯片、5G/6G偏C端、数据中心/算力、机器人", "url": "https://x.com/suyu2018block/status/2117975791611027542"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-11-05T00:33:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118139687328186394"], "id": "2118139687328186394", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 396, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "高盛中国开盘\n\n市场情绪\n6 只指数 ETF 单日成交额突破 100 亿元,这是自 2024 年 9 月 24 日以来首次出现该情况。周二当天,科创 50ETF 成交最为活跃,创业板 ETF、沪深 300ETF 紧随其后。\n自 9 月 28 日起,指数 ETF 已经连续 22 天实现资金净流入,据估算,昨日的流入规模为 2025 年 4", "url": "https://x.com/FY30Turbo/status/2118139687328186394"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-11-04T01:05:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117785305390735409"], "id": "2117785305390735409", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 421, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📰高盛中国开盘\n\n😊市场情绪\n📈6 只指数 ETF 单日成交额突破 100 亿元，这是自 2024 年 9 月 24 日以来首次出现该情况。周二当天，科创 50ETF 成交最为活跃，创业板 ETF、沪深 300ETF 紧随其后。\n💰自 9 月 28 日起，指数 ETF 已经连续 22 天实现资金净流入，据估算，昨日的流入规模为 2025 年 4", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2117785305390735409"}, {"author_id": "2115452620131450880", "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:35:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118170292237582569"], "id": "2118170292237582569", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股大盘快照 北京时间2026-11-05 10:30（盘中）\n上证指数 3694.73 +0.23%\n深证成指 11570.59 +2.07%\n创业板指 2607.74 +2.48%\n沪深300 4128.77 +0.67%\n创业板50ETF(159949) 1.177 +2.17%\n沪深两市成交额约10950亿元（沪约5057亿、深约5893亿，10:30窗口）。\n来源：腾讯行情，10:30核实盘中价 https://t.co/qf6F4KJmii", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qf6F4KJmii", "end": 228, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JayInTechInfo/status/2118170292237582569/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118170278689902592", "start": 205, "url": "https://t.co/qf6F4KJmii"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/JayInTechInfo/status/2118170292237582569"}, {"author_id": "2115452620131450880", "created_at": "2026-11-04T05:51:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117857371238400430"], "id": "2117857371238400430", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股大盘快照 北京时间2026-11-04约13:42\n上证指数 3640.83 +0.91%\n深证成指 11123.47 +2.27%\n创业板指 2464.97 +3.07%\n沪深300 4054.58 +1.14%\n创业板50ETF(159949) 1.114 +3.15%\n上涨3916家，下跌1172家；沪深两市成交额12464亿元。\n来源：东方财富盘中数据（13:40-13:42核实） https://t.co/IuiqIAYAdb", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/IuiqIAYAdb", "end": 222, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JayInTechInfo/status/2117857371238400430/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117857360547041280", "start": 199, "url": "https://t.co/IuiqIAYAdb"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/JayInTechInfo/status/2117857371238400430"}, {"author_id": "2115452620131450880", "created_at": "2026-11-04T06:30:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117867045467652292"], "id": "2117867045467652292", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股大盘快照 北京时间2026-11-04约14:21\n上证指数 3671.74 +1.76%\n深证成指 11285.38 +3.75%\n创业板指 2530.06 +5.79%\n沪深300 4086.99 +1.95%\n创业板50ETF(159949) 1.145 +6.02%\n上涨4367家，下跌804家；沪深两市成交额17012亿元。\n来源：东方财富盘中数据（14:21核实） https://t.co/ZXjNBJc4c1", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZXjNBJc4c1", "end": 215, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JayInTechInfo/status/2117867045467652292/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117867031722885120", "start": 192, "url": "https://t.co/ZXjNBJc4c1"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/JayInTechInfo/status/2117867045467652292"}, {"author_id": "2024254964324061186", "created_at": "2026-11-04T00:59:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117783763786871038"], "id": "2117783763786871038", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 68, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "早盘预测 11/4｜昨天创业板 −2.73%，跌到 20 日线下方 12.4%。模型今天反着看：创业板红，沪深300 红。\n\n昨天一对一错：上证押涨结果 −0.82%，错；创业板押跌 −2.73%，对。本周 3/4。\n\n昨天盘面：上证 −0.82% 收 3608.10；沪深300 只跌 0.20% 收 4008.87，成交额是 5 日均量的 1.26 倍；创业板", "url": "https://x.com/Sylar76529/status/2117783763786871038"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:38:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118171088618504434"], "id": "2118171088618504434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 567, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "低开2%的创业板，半小时被拉回+2.5%——今天这波深V有点意思\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2118171088618504434"}, {"author_id": "2024254964324061186", "created_at": "2026-11-05T00:58:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118145787662377223"], "id": "2118145787662377223", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "早盘预测 11/5｜昨天全 A 4667 家涨，创业板 +6.40%，情绪很热。模型今天唱个反调：上证收不回 20 日线，全 A 跌的比涨的多。\n\n昨天两条全对：创业板押涨 +6.40%，沪深300 押涨 +2.31%。本周 5/6。\n\n昨天盘面：上证 +2.16% 收 3686.17，离 20 日线还差 0.58%；沪深300 +2.31% 收 4101.34；上证成交额是", "url": "https://x.com/Sylar76529/status/2118145787662377223"}, {"author_id": "1978001990828625920", "created_at": "2026-11-05T03:38:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118186234422136889"], "id": "2118186234422136889", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 278, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "半日放量5453亿，科创50与创业板ETF爆出百亿成交，大主力资金正在借宏观拐点暴力扫货硬科技。 https://t.co/PRtmqZuw7D", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/PRtmqZuw7D", "end": 72, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jiangtao0628/status/2118186234422136889/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118186153660821504", "start": 49, "url": "https://t.co/PRtmqZuw7D"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/jiangtao0628/status/2118186234422136889"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-04T06:34:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117868010396692606"], "id": "2117868010396692606", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1487, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 下午观点 | 午后原地起飞：科创50 +9.5%、创业板 +6.3%，3600 的磨底变成了起跳板\n\n兄弟们，下午这一波，别眨眼。午间还在 3600 磨，收盘前直接给了一根大阳线。\n\n▪️ 先看指数，午后是\"加速\"，不是\"反弹\"\n\n午间：沪指 3604.37（-0.10%）、深成 10891.91（+0.14%）、创业板", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2117868010396692606"}, {"author_id": "1713359202465251328", "created_at": "2026-11-04T02:17:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117803476839535099"], "id": "2117803476839535099", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 569, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股盘面速递11-4｜大跌次日反抽，冲高回落，量还跟不上.\n\n截至10:05,上证3601.49，跌0.18%；深成指10905.91，涨0.27%；创业板指2399.86，涨0.34%；科创50报1160.49，涨0.80%；沪深300跌0.15%。", "url": "https://x.com/zhou1492987/status/2117803476839535099"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-05T06:34:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118230358236000453"], "id": "2118230358236000453", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1271, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 下午观点 | 光伏接枪、光模块交枪，沪指原地踏步——1.94万亿的分化日，钱在换车道", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2118230358236000453"}, {"author_id": "2010915618762190848", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:13:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117968484969926782"], "id": "2117968484969926782", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 165, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "你不能不叹服这安排\n\n为什么今天才涨\n天时地利人和凑齐了\n\n美国国会靴子落地\n前天定的政策今天落地\n超跌的科技也该弹了\n\n上证收3686.17涨2.16%\n创业板涨6.4%\n科创50涨9.92%\n成交2.04万亿\n比昨天多放3343亿\n4667只上涨\n\n央行回购再贷款降到1%\n银行申请额度超2000亿\n互换便利第三批也落地了", "url": "https://x.com/hugepingtan/status/2117968484969926782"}, {"author_id": "2032318224575193089", "created_at": "2026-11-04T01:04:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117785015065215077"], "id": "2117785015065215077", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【11月3日复盘】\n\n一、重磅财经信息\n\n①央行于今日开展了1000亿元证券、基金、保险互换便利操作 中标费率为10bp\n\n②发改委：“十五五”末 新兴支柱产业产值有望超10万亿元\n\n二、大盘表现\n\n沪指跌0.82%，深证成指跌1.21%，创业板指跌2.73%，科创50跌3.81%。", "url": "https://x.com/Yolandalingxzn/status/2117785015065215077"}, {"author_id": "1217151242", "created_at": "2026-11-04T01:58:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117798622221963495"], "id": "2117798622221963495", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 552, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "纳指 AI 反弹苹果掉队，韩股再砸 3.6%｜11月4日\n\n纳指收涨 0.83%，标普收涨 0.36%，道指收跌 0.38%。Nvidia 涨约 2.3%、美光涨约 2.6%，芯片权重回补；苹果跌约 1.9%，称存储成本抬升将压假日季毛利率。日股 11 月 3 日文化日休市，最近收盘为 11 月 2 日日经跌 0.33%；韩股 11 月 3 日 KOSPI 跌", "url": "https://x.com/Gracker_Gao/status/2117798622221963495"}, {"author_id": "895032812457181184", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:29:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117942229583229124"], "id": "2117942229583229124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 329, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "突发新闻：中国股市午后大逆转，沪指涨1.7%、恒指涨1.3%", "url": "https://x.com/francia781119/status/2117942229583229124"}, {"author_id": "444237949", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:18:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117924375144051003"], "id": "2117924375144051003", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 249, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "夜报，美股普涨，油价回落，A股迎来装车底，IPO暂缓底。 \n\n先吃个瓜，周三白天，美国中期选举的部分结果就要出来了。 \n特朗普能否赢下中期选举，对美股未来行情的影响很大。\n不过真正出最后结果，可能需要1周左右时间统计。 \n之前吹了好一阵的选举后打伊朗，也被各种谈判利好打断了。", "url": "https://x.com/catolicaxd/status/2117924375144051003"}, {"author_id": "154574316", "created_at": "2026-11-05T14:15:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118346485196820761"], "id": "2118346485196820761", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2267, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "今天沪深两市合计成交额约 21179.53 亿元，昨天是 20377 亿元左右，放量 802.6 亿，增幅约 3.9%。\n\n大盘连续两天放量上涨成交额站上 2 万亿🔥🔥🔥\n盘面趋势整体向好🐂，还是沿着国家队抄底方向，积极定投科创 50、创业板指、中证 1000、中证 2000、沪深 300 等方向。 https://t.co/uTdGUulYkP", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/uTdGUulYkP", "end": 174, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/9andrey9/status/2118346485196820761/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118346473951948800", "start": 151, "url": "https://t.co/uTdGUulYkP"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/uTdGUulYkP", "end": 174, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/9andrey9/status/2118346485196820761/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118346473993826304", "start": 151, "url": "https://t.co/uTdGUulYkP"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/9andrey9/status/2118346485196820761"}, {"author_id": "1380720896038424579", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:38:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118322164416057745"], "id": "2118322164416057745", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 572, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11月5日的股市复盘\n\n资金流向：大资金净流入102亿，超大资金流入66亿，散户净流出210亿，北向资金净流出135亿（缩量200亿）。\n\n超大资金动向：\n买入 ：一两融、二AI应用落地、三英伟达方向、四AI视觉听觉、五电池\n\n卖出 ：一5G/6G偏C端、二数据中心算力、三商业航天、四央国企、五证券", "url": "https://x.com/suyu2018block/status/2118322164416057745"}, {"author_id": "1764476864582864896", "created_at": "2026-11-04T07:58:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117889311139848674"], "id": "2117889311139848674", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 384, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "大盘逼近3700点，创业板指涨6.4%，科创50指数涨9.92%，暴力反弹。\n两市成交额2.03万亿，放量3300亿，自9月22日以来重返2万亿上方。\n今天国家队在沪深300ETF投入不大，从日成交额看较昨天缩量不少。\n但是创业板ETF、中证500ETF、中证1000ETF、科创50ETF成交额依旧很大。", "url": "https://x.com/HntvWang18750/status/2117889311139848674"}, {"author_id": "1813570093181194240", "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:30:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118169112522493974"], "id": "2118169112522493974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 10316, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10:30【不到1小时", "url": "https://x.com/dmjk001/status/2118169112522493974"}, {"author_id": "304165652", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:37:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118019770729771238"], "id": "2118019770729771238", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1182, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股因何强势反弹？五重催化共振\n\n财联社11月4日讯（记者 王晨）缩量调整一个多月后，A股迎来一次久违的强势反弹。\n\n成交量重回2万亿元上方，科创综指单日大涨9.9%，全市场八成个股飘红。这一天，是9月22日以来A股首次站回2万亿的量能关口，此前市场已连续25个交易日缩量。", "url": "https://x.com/najoygo/status/2118019770729771238"}, {"author_id": "1634530036152963072", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:27:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971975180292116"], "id": "2117971975180292116", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 455, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "科创50 上涨 9.92%，沪深300 上涨 2.31%，同一天相差七个多百分点。\n\n1、同样是红盘，账户的体验可以差得很远。\n\n深证成指收涨 4.22%，创业板指上涨 6.40%，上证指数上涨 2.16%。如果手里是不同的组合，哪怕都看着同一块大盘屏幕，最后算出来的账也不是一回事。 https://t.co/pyqaYjtGjU", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/pyqaYjtGjU", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/maobidao/status/2117971975180292116/photo/1", "media_key": "3